WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.500
A conversation ends.
The screen goes dark.

00:05.500 --> 00:12.000
Yet what disappeared was never
only a sequence of words.

00:12.000 --> 00:21.000
It was a path: question to discovery,
objection to revision,

00:21.000 --> 00:26.000
one fragile connection
opening the way to another.

00:26.000 --> 00:30.000
When the carrier vanishes,
who carries the journey forward?
